# Insurance Claims Data Project

## Overview

This project focuses on cleaning and storing insurance claims data using Python and DuckDB.

The dataset contains five relational tables:

- insured
- policy
- vehicle
- incident
- claim

The data was cleaned using Python and then stored in DuckDB while maintaining relationships between the tables.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- OpenPyXL
- DuckDB

## Installation

Install the required libraries:

pip install -r requirements.txt

## Running the Project

Run:

python load_cleaned_data_to_duckdb.py

This will create the DuckDB database:

insurance_project.duckdb
